# RealKevbase hints — always-on rules. Full manual: AGENTS.md.

RealKevbase is the brand store; SaveSimple is its printable-PDF collection. .NET 10 API
(`src/RealKevbase.Api` + `Core`), React 19 + Vite + MUI SPA (`src/realkevbase-web`),
PDFs rendered by `zz_tp/` (own rules: `zz_tp/AGENTS.md`; never run `tpr`).

- Products are C# seed data plus a DB row: change them with
  `python3 scripts/sync-catalog.py`.
- Shop copy is `zz_tp/documents/<listing>/listing.txt`, not the C#.
- Never copy `zz_tp/projects.db` over `src/RealKevbase.Api/Data/projects.db`.
- No secrets in the repo; the browser sees only `/api/...`.
- Ship with `./scripts/deploy.sh --yes` after a clean build; it refuses while the
  catalog is out of sync.
- Navigate with `lua scripts/repo-intel.lua overview|symbol <Name>|deps <X>` before
  opening whole files.
